{"id":"4761","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4761_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-with-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>积雨云是一种沉重而密集的云，具有相当大或强烈的垂直范围，呈山或巨大的塔形。其上面部分至少有一部分通常是光滑的、纤维状的或条纹状的，并且几乎总是扁平的。在这个图像中，鬃积雨云从西向东（从左到右）移动，并给出了形成鬃积雨云的飑线的横截面视图。在左侧有一个纤维状的扁平顶部，它已成为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状（砧状附加特征），&amp;&amp;底部有已形成的乳房状云（另一个附加特征</span>）。左边是一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状云</span>的好例子，是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状积云</span>。附加<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水性云</span>是可见的，应该指出，这种飑线会产生严重的冰雹。我们还看到了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">正在形成的浓积云细胞</span>，呈花椰菜样外观，而靠近相机的较暗、扁平的云层碎屑很可能是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨性层积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Antonio J. Galindo","location":"西班牙阿尔巴塞特Minaya","latitude":"纬度: 39° 17' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 20' 6'' W","date":"09 August 2009 2014 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4761_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-with-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC图表显示在伊比利亚西南部上空有表面上显示浅热低压（10 011 hPa），其在850 hPa处具有封闭的循环。在500 hPa图表（右上角）上，特别值得注意的是接近西班牙东部的一个急剧的高空槽（拍摄照片的地点），在最大表面加热时增强了上升流并使大气不稳定。对于伊比利亚东部的强风暴来说，这是一个典型的夏末形成风暴。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Wetterzentrale, 1995-2017","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4761_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-with-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC，西班牙穆尔西亚（WMO 08430）的探测显示对流层非常不稳定，CAPE值高达1436 J/kg，符合强对流活动的情况。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/radar/4761_radar_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-with-mamma_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>西班牙气象局（AEMET）位于瓦伦西亚的天气雷达清晰地显示出一条从西南到东北的飑线。这张照片拍摄于阿尔巴塞特和昆卡省的边界，靠近飑线的南端。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© AEMET","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4761_sat_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-with-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>1800 UTC，Meteosat 9 RGB图像清晰地显示了西班牙中东部的积雨云群和相关的飑线，其中积雨云的顶部向比利牛斯山脉延伸。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2009","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4775_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这张照片显示了发展完好的对称性云砧的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鬃积雨云细胞</span>（砧状附加特征）。砧状云下表面显示正在形成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>。左边和后面是另一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">更近期的细胞</span>。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处，这两个细胞都在产生降水。</p>\n<p>在左边缘是另一个被确定为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>的积云状细胞。这个细胞即将过渡到秃积雨云。在许多区域可以看到更多处于不同发展阶段的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n<p>积雨云被称为“云工厂”，可能产生<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>、高层云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>的云块。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mustafa Hayri Ayvaz","location":"土耳其伊斯坦布尔","latitude":"纬度: 40° 52' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 29° 12' 39'' E","date":"04 May 2016 1659 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.5"}]}]}